      "title": "Asymptotic quantum cloning is state estimation",
      "text": "Bae and Acin prove the limiting equality in full generality with a short argument via monogamy of entanglement and properties of entanglement-breaking channels. Chiribella and D'Ariano give a complementary independent proof via group-theoretic, de Finetti-type analysis of the asymptotic state of the clones, so the archived conjecture holds for every input distribution and every N.",
